# The programs QB64pe rejected whose rejection the new compiler places on another line than QB64pe's `LINE n:`
# (tests/verification/README.md, spec testing/verification-suite): <name><TAB><line><TAB><reason>. The line stands
# for QB64pe's, so the program still fails on any third line. Sorted by name.
v14_err_missing_end_sub	4	the line the block opens
v16_m3_label_then_number	3	an earlier follow-on error: the GOTO to the line number refused on line 4
v16_m4_end_sub_open_for	6	the END SUB that closes the SUB while the FOR is open (QB64pe names the FOR)
v16_m4_loop_closing_while	4	the line the block opens
v16_m4_next_in_single_if	3	the line the block opens
v16_m4_wend_closing_do	4	the line the block opens
v16_m6_one_header	6	the $END IF the block crosses
v16_m6_split_block	6	the $ELSE the block crosses
v17_e_const_fdiv0	3	diverged rejection: D-007
v24_x107_implicit_sub_name	3	an earlier error: the SUB's name used as an array (QB64pe names its next use)
v24_x215_type_function_result	7	an earlier follow-on error of the FUNCTION header refused on line 10
v24_x305_param_parens_as	4	an earlier follow-on error of the SUB header refused on line 6
v26_x40_tab_before_if	3	the cause: a tab before $IF, which QB64pe ignores (it names the $END IF)
v42_x23_sub_byval	3	an earlier follow-on error of the SUB header refused on line 8
v42_x56_sub_suffix_name	3	an earlier follow-on error of the SUB header refused on line 8
v45_x25	3	diverged rejection: D-029
v45_x32	3	diverged rejection: D-031
v45_x38	3	diverged rejection: D-029
v45_x40	3	diverged rejection: D-028
v54_x26_negative_beyond	3	diverged rejection: D-034
v55_x52_underscore_sub_array	4	an earlier follow-on error of the SUB name refused on line 7
v57_j05_block_crosses_endif	6	the $ELSEIF the block crosses
v57_j06_block_crosses_endif_agree	6	the $ELSE the block crosses
v59_x41_gl_label	13	the label's definition, not the GOTO
v66_d06_const_sin_infinite_const	3	diverged rejection: D-029
